								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16656#msg16656">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2756 on:</b> April 27, 2005, 11:16:05 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Server first!<br /><br />Conviction defeats Yar`lir on our fourth attempt, and opens The Nest on Rodcet Nife!!!!!&nbsp; Awesome work to everyone in the guild who helped bring it down!&nbsp; Was a sweet fight, and an awesome effort!&nbsp; We are now #1 on the server for DoN progression as well.
