							Grats guys <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> You did a fabulous job!  I would dare not say you&#039;re #1 in progression in DoN though, you just beat us on Yar&#039;Lir run today by 15 minutes.<br /><br />Here&#039;s the farm time <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />We finally decided to do DoN since the expansion released :P First time we actually hit it as a raid lol.<br /><br /><br /><br />Aaric<br /><br />Echoes in Eternity Officer
